w: Cra- ving par- don for Thy foes; Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus. 
w: For we know not what we do: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus. 
w: When with wrong our spir- its bleed: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus. 
w: Pro- mi- sing him par- a- dise; Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: Call- ing hum- bly on Thy Name: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: Cheer our souls with hope di- vine: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: And Thy dear- est hu- man friend: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: And en- joy Thy ten- der care: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: Lov- ing for the love of Thee, Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: While no light from Heav'n is shown: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: In the dark- ness be our stay. Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: Tell our faith that God is near: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: Thir- sting more our love to gain: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: Sa- tis- fy Thy lov- ing will: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: Where the heal- ing wa- ters flow: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: All Thy suf- f'rings per- fect made: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: While we grow in ho- li- ness: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: Till we pass to per- fect day: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
w: Yiel- ding up Thy soul at last: Hear us, ho- ly Je- sus.
